  "releaseNotes": "v1.12.0 - Horizontal radio groups with configurable markers and separators; ConfirmPrompt with Yes/No selection, submission and cancellation; ActivityTimeline with connected status markers, wrapping detail, mutable entries, and Unicode/ASCII themes. Includes interactive example pages and shared regression tests. Full release history: https://github.com/jchristn/TUIKit/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
